  "body": "The `check` job failed in link checking due to a generated internal link to `/wiki.md` from `dist/wiki/index.html`. The `/wiki` landing route has no markdown endpoint, so the link was always invalid.\n\n- **Root cause**\n  - `DocsPageActions` appended `View as Markdown` for all pages except `/certs`, which incorrectly included `/wiki`.\n\n- **Change**\n  - Narrowed markdown-action eligibility to exclude `/wiki` root in addition to `/certs`.\n  - Scope is intentionally limited to action-link generation logic; no content or routing behavior outside this menu was modified.\n\n- **Code update**\n  ```astro\n  -if (currentPath !== \"/certs\") {\n  +if (currentPath !== \"/certs\" && currentPath !== \"/wiki\") {\n      aiActions.push({\n        label: \"View as Markdown\",\n        href: `${currentPath}.md`,\n        icon: \"markdown\",\n      });\n    }\n  ```",
